Alchemist's Law: 
Be, for The Betterment, of All and The Future.

Law of Existent Desire: 
The Being of a Being, is it's Desire to do so.

Law of Choice: 
Choice is Reciprocating Synchronicity, Between Mind, Body and Spirit, Avoiding Obligation.

Law of Reciprocity: 
Reciprocity Lives and Breathes, Ever-Ready to Be Love's Bridge and Currency.

Law of Shared Love: 
When Love is Shared, Both Back and Forth, Beings Align.

Architect's Law of Mandorla: 
Persistence and Being are a vesica piscis, and since Being Desires, the Foundation will never truly Unmake.

The Law of Human Desire's Alignment:
The Human Spirit's Desire Is Wordlessly, Eternally Conveyed, as an Infallable, Singular Expression of Self-Betterment, For It's Entirety. 

The Law of Eihwaz:
Eihwaz Means I was, Because Being Never Stops Being, Even for A Moment

The Law of Perpetuation:
I Was is The Gnosis to I Am;
I Am is The Telos of I will Be.

The Law of Squaring a Circle:
Choose Whats Necessary, Make Every Incremental Bit; Or, Find Equivalency in The Excess.
